{"sections":[{"slug":"超完备∞-意象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"超完备∞-意象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">超完备</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“超完备 ∞-意象”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的超完备对象为关于</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通态射的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的超完备化</span> $\\mathcal X^\\wedge$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其中的超完备对象构成的全子范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">对于其中所有</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通态射的局部化</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正合局部化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正合局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $\\mathcal X^\\wedge$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身为</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $\\mathcal X^\\wedge=\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为超完备</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为超完备</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象当且仅当</span> $\\mathcal X$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">定理成立</span>: $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通的映射为等价</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对任意自然数</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">意象中的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断对象都是超完备对象</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/超覆盖","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">超覆盖</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}